{title: Come Down O Love Divine}
{key: C}
{time: 2/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]Come [**]down, O [G]Love [F]di[C]vine[**], [**]seek [**]thou this [Am]soul [D]of [G]mine
[G]And [F]visit [**]it with [Dm]thine own [**]ardor [G]glow[C]ing[**]
[Am]O [**]Comfor[C]ter, [D]draw [G]near[**], [Bb]with[F]in my [Dm]heart [C]ap[G]pear
[G]And [C]kindle [G]it, thy [C]holy [Dm]flame be[G]stow[C]ing[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]O [**]let it [G]free[F]ly [C]burn[**], [**]till [**]earthly [Am]pas[D]sions [G]turn
[G]To [F]dust and [**]ashes [Dm]in its [**]heat con[G]sum[C]ing[**]
[Am]And [**]let thy [C]glo[D]rious [G]light[**] [Bb]shine [F]ever [Dm]on [C]my [G]sight
[G]And [C]clothe me [G]round, the [C]while my [Dm]path il[G]lu[C]ming[**].
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]And [**]so the [G]year[F]ning [C]strong[**], [**]with [**]which the [Am]soul [D]will [G]long
[G]Shall [F]far out[**]pass the [Dm]power of [**]human [G]tell[C]ing[**]
[Am]For [**]none can [C]guess [D]its [G]grace[**], [Bb]till [F]we be[Dm]come [C]the [G]place
[G]Where[C]in the [G]Holy [C]Spirit [Dm]makes a [G]dwell[C]ing[**].
{end_of_verse}
